-------------------------------------------------------------------------
THIRD-PARTY NOTICE  (fonts, mascot, and marks — NOT MIT-licensed)
-------------------------------------------------------------------------

As the upstream Clawdmeter project notes, this repository includes proprietary
and copyrighted assets that neither the upstream author nor this fork can
relicense:

  * Fonts — "Styrene B" and "Tiempos" are commercial typefaces associated with
    Anthropic's brand. The original source font files are NOT included in this
    repository. What remains are small compiled bitmap glyph subsets baked into
    firmware/src/font_styrene_*.c and firmware/src/font_tiempos_*.c, present only
    for personal, non-commercial interoperability with Claude Code and to let the
    firmware build. They are NOT covered by the MIT license. To reuse this
    project you should regenerate these fonts from a typeface you are licensed to
    use (the free DejaVu Sans Mono in assets/ is one drop-in option).

  * The "Clawd" mascot / Claude pixel artwork and animations
    (firmware/src/logo.h, splash*.*, icons*.h, tools/claudepix_data/, and the
    demo images under assets/ and screenshots/) are the property of
    Anthropic PBC.

  * "Claude", "Claude Code", and "Anthropic" are trademarks of Anthropic PBC.
    This is an independent, unofficial hobby project and is not affiliated
    with, endorsed by, or sponsored by Anthropic.

If you intend to redistribute or sell a build of this project, you are
responsible for ensuring you have the rights to any bundled fonts and artwork,
or for replacing them with assets you are licensed to use.
